    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>When a PC succeeds on a Spellcast Roll, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to have the @Lookup[@name] make a reaction roll with a Difficulty equal to the Spellcast Roll's result. On a success, the PC's Spellcast Roll fails instead, and you place a token on this stat block. Using this feature again costs additional Fear equal to the number of tokens on this stat block. You can't Counterspell a critical success.</p>",
